===Enemy Units===
At release there were 23 [[Enemy Units]] in the game. [[Swordsman (form 1) (Enemy)|Swordsman (form 1)]], [[Li'l Gau (form 1) (Enemy)|Li'l Gau (form 1)]], [[Kerihime (form 1) (Enemy)|Kerihime (form 1)]], [[Swordsman (form 2) (Enemy)|Swordsman (form 2)]], [[Li'l Gau (form 2) (Enemy)|Li'l Gau (form 2)]], and [[Kerihime (form 2) (Enemy)|Kerihime (form 2)]] were all added to the game in an update, although they could not be fought. Most of the names and all of the descriptions are changed in the "re-release," [[The Battle Cats]]. Since the game had only 2 enemy types: [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] and [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]], enemies like [[Mooth]] and [[Assassin Bear]] are listed as Traitless. Enemies you encountered were recorded into the Dictionary, excluding collaboration enemies.

